## 🛠️ Technology Stack

| Technology                  | Purpose                            |
| --------------------------- | ---------------------------------- |
| **n8n**                     | Workflow automation                |
| **WhatsApp Business Cloud** | Patient communication              |
| **AI / LLM**                | Conversation and intent handling   |
| **PostgreSQL**              | Appointment and clinic data        |
| **JavaScript**              | Data processing and workflow logic |
| **Email**                   | Daily operational reporting        |

