## 🗄️ Database Structure

The project uses structured data for managing doctors, schedules, appointments, and operational records.

### Doctors

```text
doctor_id
doctor_name
branch
active
```

### Doctor Schedules

```text
schedule_id
doctor_id
doctor_name
branch
day
start_time
end_time
slot_duration
active
```

### Appointment Slots

```text
slot_id
doctor_name
branch
slot_date
day
start_time
end_time
status
patient_name
whatsapp_number
reason_for_visit
booked_at
meta_message_id
staff_notes
```

### Blocked Dates / Time Periods

```text
block_id
doctor_name
branch
block_date
start_time
end_time
active
```

---

## 🌍 Supported Languages

The patient-facing receptionist supports:

* 🇬🇧 English
* 🇵🇰 Urdu

The system can also process Urdu written in Roman script and respond appropriately in Urdu.

---

## ⏰ Timezone

All appointment and daily reporting logic uses:

```text
Asia/Karachi
```

This ensures that appointment dates, daily statistics, and reports are aligned with the clinic's local time.

